  decl_forward_err_return.pcpp - break step of decl_forward.pcpp:
  a return type the full declaration spells differently

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\decl_forward_err_return.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\decl_forward_err_return.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe decl_forward_err_return;

forward routine Twice(AN: int32): int32;

routine Twice(AN: int32): int64; // ERROR SM0306@1: their return types differ
begin
  return AN * 2;
end;

begin
end.
